      "description": "The emotion expressed is one of extreme hatred and dehumanization, conveyed through the hateful text overlay that equates Palestinians with 'animals' and states they 'don't deserve to live.' This emotion is not visually expressed by the elderly man but is explicitly stated in the text, which is the primary emotional element of the meme.",
